  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Buffer:\n      - Refactored Buffer architecture using Offset as start and Size as end boundaries.\n      - Implemented relative indexing for all public APIs to ensure seamless virtualization.\n      - Introduced _isPooled flag to track array origin and prevent Pool management errors.\n      - Set MaxBufferCapacity to 2,147,483,591 bytes to avoid CLR dimension overflows.\n      - Optimized Detach logic with safety guards to ensure zero-crash memory recycling.\n      - Enabled zero-capacity initialization by automatically defaulting to 256 bytes.\n      - Achieved zero-overhead performance through AggressiveInlining on all accessors.",
